你只能一个设备一个设备地去切换浏览器开关，搞坏你的通话，还得祈祷设置别被重置。
You're left flipping browser switches that break your calls, one device at a time, hoping nothing resets.

99
00:07:09,006 --> 00:07:23,332
真正能在不破坏视频通话、且不用在每个浏览器上重复操作的情况下修复 WebRTC 的方法，
是停止与浏览器设置死磕，转而使用从一开始就是密封好的浏览器。
What actually fixes WebRTC without breaking your video calls, without redoing the work on every browser,
is stopping the fight with the browser settings and using a browser that's sealed from the very start.

100
00:07:24,270 --> 00:07:25,636
